 "holes": [],
 "lines": {
  "1": "Shakeel: Hello, Fauji sahab? Shakeel bol raha hoon, mistri. Aapne plot ka naap dilwaya tha, Rewari wala.\n",
  "2": "Devendra: Haan Shakeel. Bolo. Hisaab bana?\n",
  "3": "Shakeel: Ji bana liya. Ek sau assi foot lambi deewar, chhe foot oonchi, nau inch ki eent, aur do pillar gate ke.\n",
  "4": "Devendra: Plaster?\n",
  "5": "Shakeel: Bahar ki taraf plaster, andar ki taraf nahi, jaise aapne bola tha. Andar to khet hai, zaroorat nahi.\n",
  "6": "Devendra: Theek. Rate?\n",
  "7": "Shakeel: Fauji sahab, sab milake, eent, cement, ret, sariya, mazdoori, do lakh das hazaar banta hai. Theke pe.\n",
  "8": "Devendra: Do lakh das? Shakeel, maine teen jagah se poocha hai. Dedh lakh mein log kar rahe hain.\n",
  "9": "Shakeel: Dedh mein to peeli kachchi eent lagayenge, sahab. Main pakki laal eent lagata hoon, number one. Aapki deewar bees saal khadi rahegi.\n",
  "10": "Devendra: Paune do lakh. Isse upar nahi.\n",
  "11": "Shakeel: Paune do... sahab, aap fauji aadmi ho, aapse kya behes karni. Chalo, paune do lakh, material samet.\n",
  "12": "Devendra: Paune do. Theek. Paisa kaise?\n",
  "13": "Shakeel: Pachaas hazaar shuru mein, material girana hai. Phir jab deewar kandhe tak aa jaye to pachhattar hazaar, aur baaki pachaas plaster ke baad.\n",
  "14": "Devendra: Pachaas, pachhattar, pachaas. Haan, paune do hue. Chalega.\n",
  "15": "Shakeel: Ji sahab.\n",
  "16": "Devendra: Kaam kab shuru?\n",
  "17": "Shakeel: Das December se lag jaate hain. Abhi Dharuhera mein ek kothi ka kaam chal raha hai, woh nau tak nipat jayega.\n",
  "18": "Devendra: Aur khatam?\n",
  "19": "Shakeel: Teen hafte. Ikattis December tak deewar khadi, plaster samet.\n",
  "20": "Devendra: Ikattis. Dekho Shakeel, January mein mera beta aa raha hai, us se pehle chahiye. Ikattis ke baad har din ka ek hazaar kaatunga.\n",
  "21": "Shakeel: Ek hazaar roz... sahab, baarish ho gayi to? Ya cement ki gaadi late aaye to?\n",
  "22": "Devendra: Baarish ke din nahi ginenge. Cement tumhari zimmedari hai, theke pe hai.\n",
  "23": "Shakeel: Theek hai sahab. Baarish chhod ke, ikattis ke baad hazaar roz. Manzoor.\n",
  "24": "Devendra: Aur kaam beech mein chhoda to jitna kaam hua utna hi paisa, baaki wapas.\n",
  "25": "Shakeel: Arre sahab, Shakeel ne aaj tak koi kaam adhoora nahi chhoda. Par haan, manzoor.\n",
  "26": "Devendra: Theek hai. Pachaas hazaar das tareekh ko de dunga, site pe hi.\n",
  "27": "Shakeel: Ji sahab. Aur sahab, aapka beta bhi fauj mein hai kya?\n",
  "28": "Devendra: Haan, Ladakh mein hai. Captain hai.\n",
  "29": "Shakeel: Masha Allah. Mera chhota bhi bharti ki tayyari kar raha hai, Agniveer ki. Daud mein thoda kamzor hai.\n",
  "30": "Devendra: Subah chaar baje uthao usko, paanch kilometre roz. Do mahine mein theek ho jayega.\n",
  "31": "Shakeel: Aap hi samjhao usko sahab, meri to sunta nahi.\n",
  "32": "Devendra: Bhej dena kisi din plot pe. Chalo Shakeel, das ko milte hain.\n",
  "33": "Shakeel: Ji sahab, das ko subah aath baje. Khuda hafiz.\n",
  "34": "Devendra: Jai Hind.\n"
 },
